{"title":"Spirit Realm Wanderer","synopsis":"Sepanjang sejarah, banyak legenda beredar tentang keberadaan alam spiritual. Keyakinan ini diperdebatkan sama banyak cendekiawan dari berbagai dinasti, termasuk satu puisi yang bilang: ‘Dari dinasti Qi sampai Tang, gunung ini tandus dan sepi, alam spiritual sunyi dan jarang dikunjungi. Alam spiritual enggak bisa dijelasin, dan bahkan jejak kerjaan hantu pun susah dicari.’","alternative_title":"Lingjing Xingzhe, Língjìng Xíngzhě, Mystic Domain, Spirit Realm Walker, Spiritual Realm Walker, 灵境行者","author":"Yingzhiyao","artist":"Yingzhiyao","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"76e76c88-debe-49bd-b166-2053154d5dc1","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"0ed3bb20-0de4-4780-8e3c-f9a1ecf1b76c","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"12e3fedf-af2e-46b6-825a-1179f6a0581e","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"aed6c396-a7da-4cf7-9ccb-4104f60a860b","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"eec68a94-4e88-4b33-8adc-904b723c4ecd","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"ff91ae76-1956-4b3b-afc2-c2b6d6d995b8","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"40aa1804-fdff-49c6-9977-b9ecd130231d","number":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"6e2fb270-1cf9-4e55-bb68-ee3ae390eeb9","number":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"2f587a14-76af-4165-826c-6cc55a7b7b27","number":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"af05cf7e-e8db-4bf9-9ca0-a4e0f522d7f1","number":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"id":"0d430726-61b7-485f-8890-7d2b40732f68","number":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"id":"82da2388-b3a1-49be-b089-9d5caff2601b","number":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-07-21","images":